        <mxCell id="card37" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fillStyle=solid;fillColor=#E2EEFC;strokeColor=#4F7DB5;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Patrick Hand;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DPatrick%2BHand;fontSize=19;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;spacingLeft=62;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:30px;color:#1F2328;margin-bottom:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FC ⇄ ToolEnv (từng bước)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bước 1&lt;/b&gt; · Q1 → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:21px;color:#3A3F47&quot;&gt;contacts.search&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Q2: query điền? → có · sinh: query = &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:21px;color:#3A3F47&quot;&gt;&quot;Tuấn&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;validate ✓ → call → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:21px;color:#3A3F47&quot;&gt;{contacts: [{id: &quot;c_07&quot;, name: &quot;Tuấn&quot;}]}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ msgs, seen&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bước 2&lt;/b&gt; · Q1 → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:21px;color:#3A3F47&quot;&gt;ewallet.transfer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Q2: contact_id điền? → có → chọn trong seen: &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:21px;color:#3A3F47&quot;&gt;&quot;c_07&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Q2: phone điền? → không · note điền? → không&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;sinh: amount = &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:21px;color:#3A3F47&quot;&gt;180000&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;i&gt;“180 nghìn”&lt;/i&gt; lấy từ memory)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;validate ✓ → call → &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:21px;color:#3A3F47&quot;&gt;{transaction: &quot;tx_01&quot;, balance: 1070000}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:26px;color:#1F2328;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bước 3&lt;/b&gt; · Q1 → DỪNG&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
